  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/1"/>Gird Yourself with righteousness,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/2"/>eternal and lofty Reposer.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/3"/>Support the stumblers,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/4"/>extend Your hand to lift them
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/5"/>whose tear is their drink,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/6"/>whose groan is their bread.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/7"/>Avenge the blood of Your servants
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/8"/>from their enemies, until they are no more.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/9"/>Look at their blood that is shed
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/10"/>to know why and wherefore this.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_2/11"/>This sign will take place tomorrow.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
